{"id":"n71111-3-5","stage":1,"title":"음 · 哦","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71111-3-5-1","ko":"나는 학교 다닐 때 만날 일 등만 했어.","zh":"我上学时总是考第一。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다닐","meaning":"上班，上学，上","explanation":"다니다：上班，上学，上；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"3","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"만날","meaning":"天天，常常，老是","explanation":"만날：天天，常常，老是","readings":[{"term":"만날","audio":"/audio/06e9ab2bbb32c974c856.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50307","senseId":"1","lemma":"만날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"등만","meaning":"等，等等","explanation":"등：等，等等；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"등","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49992","senseId":"1","lemma":"등","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했어.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"上班，上学，上","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"定期往返于职场或学校等地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"06e9ab2bbb32c974","term":"만날","zh":"天天，常常，老是","audio":"/audio/06e9ab2bbb32c974c856.mp3","entryId":"50307","definition":"几乎一天不停地。","pronunciation":["만ː날"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"ad8c9dea07d94cab","term":"등","zh":"等，等等","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3","entryId":"49992","definition":"表示前面所说之外还有一些同类的东西。","pronunciation":["등ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0e5524bb71a20aaf9bb7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71111-3-5-2","ko":"음, 네가 정말 그랬단 말이야?","zh":"嗯，你当时真那么厉害？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"음,","meaning":"哦","explanation":"음：哦","readings":[{"term":"음","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71111","senseId":"3","lemma":"음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그랬단","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；단：引用陈述内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말이야?","meaning":"意思","explanation":"말：意思；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"7","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"95e3c75cd502220b","term":"음","zh":"哦","audio":"/audio/95e3c75cd502220bd32f.mp3","entryId":"71111","definition":"不相信时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["음"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"意思","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表示再次强调或确认。","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/797b75da83845035b4bc.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.18,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71111","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":31,"sequenceScore":1.5202,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我上学时总是考第一。","嗯，你当时真那么厉